      "text": "platform  10.0.0.0/16   AzureBastionSubnet 10.0.0.0/26 · GatewaySubnet 10.0.1.0/27\ndev       10.1.0.0/16   Auth .1.0/24 · World .2.0/24 · Database .3.0/24 · AppService .4.0/24\nprod      10.2.0.0/16   Auth .1.0/24 · World .2.0/24 · Database .3.0/24 · AppService .4.0/24\n\nThe three /16 ranges must not overlap — peering creation fails if they do.",
